# Clock constraint for the ECP5 synthesis flow (issue #75).
#
# The flow measures resources and Fmax without a board, so only the clock is
# constrained; there are no pin LOC constraints (run_synth.sh passes
# --lpf-allow-unconstrained). 100 MHz is the target the tools optimise for;
# the achieved Fmax is what nextpnr reports after routing, whether or not the
# target is met, and both numbers land in synth_summary.csv.
FREQUENCY PORT "clk" 100 MHz;
